KONOHAGAKURE BINGO BOOK — S-RANK THREAT PROFILE

Name: Itachi Uchiha
Village of Origin: Konohagakure (defected)
Status: Missing-nin / Akatsuki member
Threat Level: S-Rank
Bounty: 30,000,000 ryo (dead or alive)

Background: Former ANBU captain, prodigy of the Uchiha clan. Graduated the Academy at age 7, awakened the Sharingan at 8, promoted to Chunin at 10. Perpetrator of record in the Uchiha clan massacre.

Known Abilities:
- Mangekyo Sharingan: Tsukuyomi (genjutsu), Amaterasu (black flame), Susanoo.
- Fire Release: Great Fireball Technique, Phoenix Sage Fire.
- Master-level genjutsu; capable of casting with a single glance.

Engagement Notes: Do NOT make eye contact. Genjutsu resistance training mandatory before any pursuit. Travels in a two-man Akatsuki cell (see kisame_profile). Objective assessed to be capture of the Nine-Tails jinchuriki.

Approved for distribution: Hokage's Office, Jonin and above only.
